<title>BELGIUM: Fina Inc Q1 1997 net EPS rises to $1.25.</title>
<headline>Fina Inc Q1 1997 net EPS rises to $1.25.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>    Shr		   $1.25	   vs	    $1.22</p>
<p>    Net	     39,150		vs	38,022</p>
<p>    Revs	 1,114,068		vs     965,115</p>
<p>NOTE - Fina Inc is a unit of Belgian oil group Petrofina</p>
